3
00:00:57,820 --> 00:00:58,660
Good morning.

4
00:00:58,660 --> 00:00:59,740
My mic on?

5
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:05,020
Dave, I know I'm hot, but is my mic on?

6
00:01:05,020 --> 00:01:11,760
We're full of unscripted jokes today.

7
00:01:11,760 --> 00:01:14,060
Can you hear me?

8
00:01:14,060 --> 00:01:20,720
Dave says keep, or Doc says keep rolling, so I'm going to keep rolling there.

9
00:01:20,720 --> 00:01:21,580
