What would I do if I won the lottery?

102
00:07:28,640 --> 00:07:32,380
Has anybody ever had similar daydreams?

103
00:07:32,380 --> 00:07:34,020
I'm hopefully not alone in that.

104
00:07:34,020 --> 00:07:35,860
Well, I want you to just do me a favor.

105
00:07:35,860 --> 00:07:38,720
This is going to be probably the only time you'll ever hear me say this from stage.

106
00:07:38,720 --> 00:07:41,260
